  "prefLabel": "Puc 402.17 Secretary of state certificate of authority",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 402.17 \"Secretary of state certificate of authority\" means the certificate of legal existence, certificate of authority, or other certification issued by the New Hampshire secretary of state which authorizes an entity to transact business in the state.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Puc 400) #14029, eff 7-25-24",
